      "pick_a_target_adjust_your_telescope_ey": "Pick a target, adjust your telescope, eyepiece, sky conditions — see what would actually be visible. This simulator approximates real visual appearance: small telescopes show less; light-polluted skies wash out faint objects; higher magnification shrinks the field of view + dims everything.",
      "pick_one_thing_to_find_tonight_don_t_t": "□ Pick ONE thing to find tonight. Don't try to learn everything.",
