      "some_non_compliance_is_a_trauma_respon": "Some \"non-compliance\" is a trauma response, not a learning deficit. A child who freezes, flees, or fights at a familiar demand may be telling you the demand has become a threat cue. Regulation comes before reasoning; co-regulation comes before self-regulation. Contingency analysis still matters — it just is not the whole picture.",
