      "wing3d_look": "Look for: ",
      "wing3d_look_droop": "Front on: the wings are not a flat plank. They fall away from the shoulder, and how much they do that differs by wing.",
      "wing3d_look_slots_no": "This wing has no slotted fingers — the outer edge stays one clean surface. Switch to the soaring wing to compare.",
      "wing3d_look_slots_yes": "Look from below: the outer feathers separate into upswept fingers. Those slots are what let a soaring bird stay up at low speed.",
      "wing3d_look_span": "Look along the span from the wingtip to see how much of the wing is length and how much is width.",
      "wing3d_preset_above": "⬒ From above — see the planform",
