      "sperm_whales_dive_to_2000m_to_hunt_gia": "Sperm whales dive to 2000m to hunt giant + colossal squid. Their sonar penetrates the dark + the depth + the ink. This is the apex threat your species faces.",
      "sperm_whales_eat_100_million_tonnes_of": "Sperm whales eat ~100 million tonnes of cephalopod biomass per YEAR globally — making sperm whales among the largest cephalopod predators on Earth.",
      "sperm_whales_eat_700_squid_per_whale_p": "Sperm whales eat 700 squid PER WHALE PER DAY. Globally, sperm whales consume ~100 million tonnes of cephalopods annually.",
      "sperm_whales_hunt_squid_using_powerful": "Sperm whales hunt squid using powerful echolocation clicks up to 230 dB. They can dive over 2000 m and stay submerged for up to 90 minutes. A single whale eats 700+ squid per day.",
      "sperm_whales_social_evolution_in_the_o": "Sperm Whales: Social Evolution in the Ocean",
