      "tips_2": "💡 Tips: ",
      "to_the_bacterial_population_more_o_mor": " to the bacterial population — more O₂ = more bioluminescence (Vibrio fischeri uses oxygen as the oxidizer in the luciferin reaction). The squid sends regulated O₂ pulses to dial brightness up + down throughout the night.",
      "today_popular_culture_treats_them_as_c": "Today, popular culture treats them as candidates for a SECOND INDEPENDENT INSTANCE of consciousness on Earth. Books, films, and laws all converge on the idea that octopuses + their relatives might have inner experiences as rich as our own — built from a completely different evolutionary architecture.",
      "tongues_tentacles_and_trunks_the_biome": "Tongues, tentacles and trunks: the biomechanics of movement in muscular hydrostats",
