      "trait_divergence_milestone_limit": "A geographic barrier splits an ancestral population. Each half evolves under its own pressure. This simplified model marks a teaching milestone when one trait's overlap proxy falls below 30%. Real speciation requires evidence of independently evolving lineages and reproductive isolation or other species criteria; this activity does not test mating.",
