      "a_trusted_adult": "A trusted adult: ",
      "aap_says_outright_that_energy_drinks_m": "AAP says outright that energy drinks (Monster, Red Bull, etc.) \"should not be consumed by children or adolescents.\" High caffeine doses, heart-rhythm effects, and added stimulants are the reason. They are not in this comparison because they should not be on this list.",
      "about_1_2_body_weight_fluid_deficit_at": "About 1-2% body-weight fluid deficit. Attention, mood, short-term memory measurably drop here. Drink now.",
