      "folate": "Folate",
      "follow_creators_with_bodies_of_varied_": "Follow creators with bodies of varied sizes who DO NOT center food/weight conversations. Athletes, scientists, comedians, gardeners, artists. The algorithm starts feeding you more of who you watch.",
