      "20_major_geothermal_power_plants_world": "20 major geothermal power plants worldwide. Geothermal harvests plate-tectonic heat - divergent and subduction-zone settings dominate.",
      "20_major_seafloor_features_including_r": "20 major seafloor features including ridges, trenches, fracture zones, hotspot tracks, and submarine volcanoes. Most of Earth's surface is under water; this is where plate tectonics is most active.",
      "20_of_the_most_important_geological_ev": "20 of the most important geological events in human + Earth history. From the Great Oxygenation Event 2.4 billion years ago to the 2023 Turkey-Syria doublet earthquake.",
      "20_of_the_world_s_notable_cave_systems": "20 of the world's notable cave systems. Most are karst (limestone dissolved by acidic water), but volcanic + tectonic caves exist too.",
      "20_sites_that_record_human_evolution_m": "20 sites that record human evolution. Most cluster in East Africa (Olduvai, Hadar, Lake Turkana) where Rift Valley tectonics expose 4+ million years of sediments.",
