      "bip_s2": "Step 2 — Antecedent",
      "bip_s2_p": "What reliably happens immediately before? Include the setting events that make it more likely.",
      "bip_s3": "Step 3 — Hypothesised function",
      "bip_s3_p": "What does the behaviour reliably GET or AVOID? A hypothesis you would test with ABC data, not a label.",
      "bip_s4": "Step 4 — Replacement behaviour",
      "bip_s4_p": "What should the student do INSTEAD that gets the same function, faster and more reliably than the problem behaviour did?",
      "bip_s5": "Step 5 — Teaching and reinforcement",
