      "a_bmx_bike_weighs_12_kg_vs_a_skateboar": "A BMX bike weighs ~12 kg vs a skateboard's ~4 kg, and the wheels are much bigger. Moment of inertia I = m·r² determines how much torque you need to spin. Same arm strength → less rotation per second. That's why BMX flips and spins look more deliberate than skate spins — the rider is fighting more rotational mass for the same air time.",
